# Jade Seedstones // Jadeheart Attendant. As the Seedstones enter, three +1/+1 counters are divided among Bot1's Llanowar
# Elves and Embereth Shieldbreaker, two and one (CR 601.2d). The Shieldbreaker is then bolted into Bot1's graveyard, and
# on turn seven the Seedstones craft with it, a creature card in the graveyard (Craft with creature {5}{G}{G}), returning
# as Jadeheart Attendant, a 7/7 green Golem artifact creature. "When this creature enters, you gain life equal to the mana
# value of the exiled card used to craft it" (CR 702.167c): the Shieldbreaker's, 2.

